or teamwork beyond perception. Might still be okay.\n\nWe could ask other agents for missing info: e.g., does Candidate A handle stress well? Does Candidate D handle stress? But we must produce current provisional preference now.\n\nGiven current info, I lean toward Candidate A as provisional favorite, with moderate confidence (~55%). Uncertainty: impact of show-off and closedness on crew cooperation; lack of data on stress handling. Would change if others provide evidence of strong teamwork for other candidates or severe deficits for A.\n\nLet's produce output."}
